      <title>Vanguard's Wang: Energy, AI Keep Inflation High</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-05/vanguard-s-wang-energy-ai-keep-inflation-high-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">cd974d0325231a1cb7c859a8</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 00:01:41 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Vanguard Chief Economist Qian Wang projects inflation will reach around 3% by year-end before easing toward 2.5% by the end of 2027. She identifies elevated energy prices and near-term AI capital investment as the primary drivers keeping price pressures high. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
